### Health
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/health

### Search (relevance)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/products?q=iphone 17 pro 256&page_size=5

### Search, cheapest first, with price band
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/products?q=macbook&min_price=40000&max_price=60000&sort=price_asc

### Products sold by one store that are in stock
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/products?retailer_id=1&in_stock=true&page=1&page_size=10

### Product with offers
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/products/2909

### Offers only, most expensive first
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/products/2909/offers?sort=price_desc

### Price history, 14 days
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/products/2909/history?days=14

